01:04:13.420 --> 01:04:16.710
Tak pasal-pasal dia merepek sangat.

01:04:31.060 --> 01:04:32.100
Hei

01:04:32.730 --> 01:04:34.520
Anda tahu siapa saya, bukan?

01:04:35.900 --> 01:04:38.020
